  <li><a href="/qr/games/"><span>Games<small>Ways to play and learn with your deck</small></span></a></li>
  <li><a href="/qr/pronounciation/"><span>Pronunciation help<small>Elementary, intermediate and advanced guides</small></span></a></li>
